{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 906,
 "duration": 30.2,
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If you stuck a needle",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 0.152,
   "end": 0.96,
   "show": 0.112,
   "hide": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "into a DEAD spider\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "dead"
   ],
   "start": 1.08,
   "end": 2.56,
   "show": 1.04,
   "hide": 2.6
  },
  {
   "text": "you could make its legs MOVE again.",
   "emph": [
    "move"
   ],
   "start": 2.64,
   "end": 4.48,
   "show": 2.6,
   "hide": 4.52
  },
  {
   "text": "Because when a spider dies,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 4.56,
   "end": 5.96,
   "show": 4.52,
   "hide": 5.96
  },
  {
   "text": "all its legs curl inward.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 6.0,
   "end": 7.8,
   "show": 5.96,
   "hide": 7.8
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, spiders use fluid pressure",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 7.84,
   "end": 9.68,
   "show": 7.8,
   "hide": 9.72
  },
  {
   "text": "to straighten their legs.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 9.76,
   "end": 10.987,
   "show": 9.72,
   "hide": 10.96
  },
  {
   "text": "And when they die,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 11.0,
   "end": 11.973,
   "show": 10.96,
   "hide": 11.987
  },
  {
   "text": "that pressure disappears.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 12.027,
   "end": 13.48,
   "show": 11.987,
   "hide": 13.48
  },
  {
   "text": "So scientists attached a syringe",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 13.52,
   "end": 15.2,
   "show": 13.48,
   "hide": 15.2
  },
  {
   "text": "to a dead spider\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 15.24,
   "end": 16.453,
   "show": 15.2,
   "hide": 16.467
  },
  {
   "text": "and pumped air inside.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 16.507,
   "end": 18.08,
   "show": 16.467,
   "hide": 18.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Its legs suddenly spread OPEN.",
   "emph": [
    "open"
   ],
   "start": 18.16,
   "end": 20.107,
   "show": 18.12,
   "hide": 20.07
  },
  {
   "text": "But when they released the pressure\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 20.11,
   "end": 21.64,
   "show": 20.07,
   "hide": 21.63
  },
  {
   "text": "the legs CLAMPED SHUT.",
   "emph": [
    "clamped",
    "shut"
   ],
   "start": 21.67,
   "end": 23.387,
   "show": 21.63,
   "hide": 23.39
  },
  {
   "text": "They'd turned a dead spider",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 23.43,
   "end": 24.64,
   "show": 23.39,
   "hide": 24.72
  },
  {
   "text": "into a working claw.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 24.76,
   "end": 26.187,
   "show": 24.72,
   "hide": 26.17
  },
  {
   "text": "And they actually used it",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 26.21,
   "end": 27.28,
   "show": 26.17,
   "hide": 27.32
  },
  {
   "text": "to pick up\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 27.36,
   "end": 28.187,
   "show": 27.32,
   "hide": 28.253
  },
  {
   "text": "ANOTHER dead spider.",
   "emph": [
    "another"
   ],
   "start": 28.293,
   "end": 29.6,
   "show": 28.253,
   "hide": 30.2
  }
 ],
